      "body": "Ok, I've thought about it. Since we're moving towards removing un-necessary fields in static structures, I think it's better to just have a single `NULL` for a sentinel (ideally, a macro would be better so that we don't need to indicate that XXX is a sentinel but let's keep the diff smaller). I'll also update my other PRs.",
